The wallet logic is ported from Kilowallet for Android (github.com/Kilombino/kilowallet,
Apache-2.0). RIPEMD-160, BLAKE2b, Base58Check, Bech32/Bech32m, BIP-39, BIP-32, the BIP-143 and
unified sighashes and the BLAKE2b block header hash are implemented in this repository from their
public specifications.

Third-party libraries (Apache-2.0):
 - secp256k1-kmp by ACINQ (fr.acinq.secp256k1), which bundles Bitcoin Core's libsecp256k1 (MIT)
 - KotlinCrypto hash/macs (org.kotlincrypto): SHA-256, HMAC-SHA256/512
 - Kotlin, kotlinx.coroutines, kotlinx.serialization, Compose Multiplatform by JetBrains
